# Cursor Rules

This project uses CLAUDE.md as the primary source of coding guidelines and conventions.

**IMPORTANT: Always refer to CLAUDE.md for:**

- Code conventions and documentation standards
- Commit message guidelines
- Project architecture and development workflow
- Testing procedures

Before making any changes, review the relevant sections in CLAUDE.md to ensure compliance with project standards.

Key rules from CLAUDE.md:

- All code comments must be written in English
- All commit messages must be written in English
- Do NOT include AI attribution in commit messages
